From 523abe8fd9deabf268992bb723bc69376223f8a9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: dev <dev@example.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 16:17:39 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add free 15-minute trial sessions

- Professionals add trial windows (date + time range) on the dashboard and
  join form; each window is cut into 15-minute slots
- Clients book a trial from the booking page (or ?kind=trial) with no
  payment; the server validates the slot, creates the booking as
  'confirmed' with amount 0 and emails the client
- One active trial per client per professional (MAX_TRIAL_BOOKINGS_PER_CLIENT)
- About page shows the free trial; My bookings and the dashboard show
  trial bookings as 'Free trial'
